OL,3,GNEWSAWhat are my children exposed to?
OL,4,AWhy I want testing for cancer-causing
OL,5,Achemicals
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhen she moved to the countryside two
OL,8,Fyears ago, Natalie Dugdale thought it
OL,9,Fwould be the perfect spot to raise her
OL,10,Ffamily.
OL,12,FClose to a lagoon in north Wales, she
OL,13,Fthought she could walk her baby,
OL,14,Ftoddler and dogs on public footpaths.
OL,16,FBut when she watched Michael Sheen's
OL,17,FBBC documentary revealing the lagoon's
OL,18,Fhistory as a dumping ground of
OL,19,Fcancer-causing chemicals known as PCBs,
OL,20,FNatalie was shocked.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
