OL,3,GNEWSAWhat are my children exposed to?
OL,4,AWhy I want testing for cancer-causing
OL,5,Achemicals
OL,6,
OL,7,FNow she is part of a group of people
OL,8,Fwho are worried they may have been
OL,9,Fpoisoned by years of exposure to toxic
OL,10,Fwaste, and are campaigning for
OL,11,Fvoluntary blood testing across Wales.
